  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "Now measure the work.",
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 1120,
      "start_frame": 0,
      "end_frame": 34,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "We can try up to n starting numbers.",
      "start_ms": 1520,
      "end_ms": 3640,
      "start_frame": 46,
      "end_frame": 109,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "From one start, the sequence can continue up to n steps.",
      "start_ms": 4160,
      "end_ms": 7880,
      "start_frame": 125,
      "end_frame": 236,
      "word_count": 11
    },
    {
      "text": "And each next value in nums, check can itself scan up to n values.",
      "start_ms": 8480,
      "end_ms": 12900,
      "start_frame": 254,
      "end_frame": 387,
      "word_count": 14
    },
    {
      "text": "So worst case, n times n times n.",
      "start_ms": 13220,
      "end_ms": 16460,
      "start_frame": 397,
      "end_frame": 494,
      "word_count": 8
    },
    {
      "text": "O of n cubed.",
      "start_ms": 16860,
      "end_ms": 17900,
      "start_frame": 506,
      "end_frame": 537,
      "word_count": 4
    },
    {
      "text": "The real problem is repeated searching.",
      "start_ms": 18620,
      "end_ms": 21180,
      "start_frame": 559,
      "end_frame": 635,
      "word_count": 6
    },
    {
      "text": "Every time we need the next value, we may scan the same unsorted array again.",
      "start_ms": 22020,
      "end_ms": 28980,
      "start_frame": 661,
      "end_frame": 869,
      "word_count": 15
    },
    {
      "text": "So what if we remove that searching?",
      "start_ms": 29640,
      "end_ms": 31980,
      "start_frame": 889,
      "end_frame": 959,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "What if the numbers are arranged first?",
      "start_ms": 32780,
      "end_ms": 35500,
      "start_frame": 983,
      "end_frame": 1065,
      "word_count": 7
    },
    {
      "text": "Then if two values are consecutive, they should come next to each other.",
      "start_ms": 36300,
      "end_ms": 41400,
      "start_frame": 1089,
      "end_frame": 1242,
      "word_count": 13
    },
    {
      "text": "Let's see what that changes.",
      "start_ms": 42640,
      "end_ms": 44100,
      "start_frame": 1279,
      "end_frame": 1323,
      "word_count": 5
    }
  ],
